# Quiz System Current Milestone Rules

Current Phase 8B scope includes only these units:

Quiz Portal Home
Available Quiz List
Empty Quiz State
Locked Quiz State
Quiz Instructions
Quiz Session Shell
Multiple Choice Single Presenter
Multiple Choice Multiple Presenter
True/False Presenter
Unsupported Item State
Submit Confirmation
Quiz Result Screen
Quiz Error/Retry State

Do not implement other quiz item presenters unless explicitly approved.

Use UI Toolkit for the Phase 8B quiz UI.

Use existing UI assets and components first.

Do not hardcode quiz content in UI scripts.

Quiz UI must use shared stores, services, presenters, DTOs, and provider interfaces.

The Quiz Portal must be separate from future adventure missions.

Quiz completion must not update mission progress.

Quiz result display may show score, feedback, pass/fail, and optional display-only stars or badges. It must not grant spendable coins, inventory items, EXP, cosmetics, or shop currency.

Required quiz states include loading, available, empty, locked, instructions, answering, validation error, submit confirmation, submitting, result, unsupported item, and error/retry.

Unsupported item types must show a safe state and must not crash.

For multiple choice single, allow one selected option.

For multiple choice multiple, allow multiple selected options and clear selected state correctly.

For true/false, use two clear answer options.

Submit Confirmation must summarize unanswered/invalid items without showing answer keys.

Quiz Result Screen must respect provider/server result visibility.

Quiz Error/Retry State must provide safe retry, return to quiz portal, and return to menu behavior where applicable.
